Package: AlgaeScan
Type: Package
Title: Machine Learning Analysis of Spectral Flow Cytometry Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(
        given = "Sebastiano",
        family = "Montante",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        email = "s.montante@exeter.ac.uk"
    )
Description: Provides tools for importing, processing, analysing, training,
    and applying machine learning models to spectral flow cytometry data
    for phytoplankton classification. AlgaeScan supports customizable
    workflows for algae detection, taxonomic classification, dimensionality
    reduction, model evaluation, and prediction on new samples.
